  {
   "id": "broken-pieces-137286@1.3",
   "gameId": "broken-pieces-137286",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-15T23:52:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It is now a few month past the release and thank you so much for all your feedbacks ! We took them all in and have worked hard making another patch which addresses some of the feedback we have received! So Patch 1.3 is here - featuring some long-requested features! This includes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shoulder camera option. ( At the start of a new game you will have to decide which camera style sits better with you )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved graphics ( Overal improvement of look and lighting )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Shoulder combat system ( Well this had to be done in order to make the shoulder camera style fits )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sprint mechanic ( Let's go fast from point A to point B )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Deck Support ( Aiming to go from playable to verified )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Cloud Save Support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And much more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll have a new trailer coming soon! Check out some of these new screenshots showing off the improved graphics! In the meantime, be sure to follow us on Twitter!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
